                                "sense_id": "0ca7ce45-6a42-377b-bd78-f893e242ffef",
                                "text": "I don't think it's any diff then in grade school when someone said \"come on take a drag it will make you look cool\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "124d02a9-6878-4879-9640-44fc1bca3a5e",
                                "sense_id": "0ca7ce45-6a42-377b-bd78-f893e242ffef",
                                "text": "Is there a way to tell it to pick a diff one by default?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
